cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CAIA, please cite it as below."
title: "CAIA: Climate Action Impact Analysis"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Barkman
    given-names: Henric
    affiliation: Karlstads kommun
version: 1.0.1
date-released: 2026-11-09
license: EUPL-1.2
repository-code: "https://github.com/karlstadskommun/caia"
abstract: >-
  CAIA estimates the climate effect of a municipal climate action.
  A seven-step pipeline of language model calls produces an action profile,
  a baseline and sourced assumptions, which the user approves or corrects;
  a deterministic calculation in Python then gives tonnes CO2e per year and
  a report that shows where every number came from.
keywords:
  - climate
  - municipality
  - greenhouse gas emissions
  - sweden
